{"articleNo":"892","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=892&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"참여학생 모집안내 [그린에너지시스템인재양성센터]","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.08.29","hit":"18976","attachments":[{"name":"참여확인서.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=892&attachNo=69319"},{"name":"학생 선발 안내(최종).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=892&attachNo=70122"},{"name":"그린에너지시스템 인재양성센터 FAQ.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=892&attachNo=70177"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">본 센터는 교육과학기술부가 주관하는『</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">광역경제권 선도산업 인재양성사업』</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">에서 그린에너지 분야에 선정되어 향후 5년간 총 266억원의 사업비로 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.3pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: large\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY울릉도B&quot;\">\"선도산업 맞춤형 인재양성\"<br>\"기업기반 창의적 교육 및 연구\"<br>\"산학연관 융합체제 구축\"</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">을 추진하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY울릉도B&quot;\">글로벌 역량을 갖춘 창조적 인재를 양성</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">할 계획입니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><br>다음과 같이 참여학생을 모집하오니 많은 참여를 부탁합니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n    <li><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">참여대상<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - (학부)기계공학부, 전자공학부<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - (전공) 고분자, 산업시스템, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">정보나노소재, 응용화학, 환경공학<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 상기 학부/전공의 </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">학부생 2~4학년 재학생</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">과 해당 </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">대학원 석사과정</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;<br></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - (1학년 학부생, 박사과정 제외)</span> <br type=\"_moz\">&nbsp; </li>\n    <li><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: larger\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">선발기준<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">학부성적 및 어학성적</span> <br type=\"_moz\">&nbsp; </li>\n    <li><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">학생 선발 공고 및 접수<br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">공고: 8월 27일 ~ (일반 학부생, 석사, 학부연구생 등 공통)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -</span> 제출서류: 공인어학성적표, 성적표(원본), 참여확인서(자필본, 홈페이지 참조)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -</span> 접수기간(학사):&nbsp;</span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\"><u><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">9월 1일 (PM2:00~PM8:00)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">,</span></u></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><u><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">9월 2일~7일 (AM10:00~PM8:00)<br></span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"> 접수처: </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">센터 행정실 (공실관405호)</span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br type=\"_moz\">&nbsp; </li>\n    <li><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\">발표 및 추천학생&nbsp;<br></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; -</span></span></span> 선정발표: </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">9월 14일(월) 오후</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"> 중 <a href=\"http://gec.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\">센터 홈페이지</a>에 공고 예정&nbsp; (<a href=\"http://gec.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\">http://gec.kumoh.ac.kr</a>)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -</span></span></span> 학부/전공 추천 및 대학원생 선정 및 확정: 9월 16일(수)</span><br type=\"_moz\">&nbsp; </li>\n    <li><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">기타<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\"><br></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -</span></span></span> </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">자세한 사항은 첨부파일을 참조하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -</span></span></span> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">대학원생 및 학부/전공 추천생은 각 학부 및 전공의 추천에 의해 진행 예정입니다.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -</span></span></span> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"hwp-tab: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"한컴돋움\">선발관련 문의는 학생설명회 및 \"질문과 답변 게시판\"를 이용해 주시기 바랍니다.</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><br type=\"_moz\">&nbsp; </li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\">그린에너지시스템 인재양성센터</span></div>\n</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
